4
00:00:11,962 --> 00:00:12,508
I can't.

5
00:00:12,682 --> 00:00:14,440
Ah, I knew it!

6
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:28,871
Hi, my name is Peter Parker.

7
00:00:31,033 --> 00:00:33,273
You don't remember me, but we used to know each

8
00:00:33,153 --> 00:00:33,451
other.

9
00:00:34,579 --> 00:00:36,497
Something bad was gonna happen, and the only way to

10
00:00:36,377 --> 00:00:39,284
stop it was to make everyone forget

11
00:00:39,164 --> 00:00:39,770
about me.

12
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:44,065
Because I'm not just Peter Parker.

13
00:00:44,992 --> 00:00:46,979
I'm Spider-Man.

14
00:00:47,230 --> 00:00:50,506
What

15
00:00:51,014 --> 00:00:51,928
the hell, Frank?

16
00:00:51,905 --> 00:00:53,230
You just hit me with a van!

17
00:00:53,208 --> 00:00:55,395
Put your web ring on.

18
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:56,029
