19
00:01:01,830 --> 00:01:02,274
Motherfucker!

20
00:01:02,251 --> 00:01:03,100
Go home!

21
00:01:04,552 --> 00:01:07,216
And sometimes Spider-Man has to do the hard thing,

22
00:01:07,615 --> 00:01:12,160
