24
00:01:18,323 --> 00:01:19,218
Oh God!

25
00:01:21,700 --> 00:01:26,020
Excuse me, Dr.

26
00:01:26,238 --> 00:01:28,627
Banner, I need your help.

27
00:01:30,776 --> 00:01:31,730
What'd you say your name was?

28
00:01:35,104 --> 00:01:38,110
If DNA is mutating, it would be enormously

29
00:01:37,990 --> 00:01:38,783
