39
00:02:23,452 --> 00:02:24,088
Nice flowers.

40
00:02:24,322 --> 00:02:26,618
Oh, they're, uh, a housewarming gift.

41
00:02:26,827 --> 00:02:27,538
I'm MJ.

42
00:02:27,599 --> 00:02:29,537
I'm just a Neighbor from across the hall.

43
00:02:30,077 --> 00:02:30,680
Friendly neighbor.

44
00:02:31,059 --> 00:02:31,598
Cough.
